{
    "comment": "개인정보 탭 — 보유기간이 지난 개인정보 파기와 휴면 계정 생명주기를 켜고 끄는 자리다.\n  전 기능 기본 꺼짐이고, 켜는 순간부터 **되돌릴 수 없는 파기**가 일어나므로 각 카드에\n  법령 근거와 사전 안내 의무를 함께 적는다.\n  기간 입력은 토글이 켜져 있을 때만 보여 준다 — 꺼진 채로 보이면 값을 고쳐도 아무 일이\n  없어 설정이 먹히지 않는 것처럼 읽힌다(보안 탭의 적용 범위 칸과 같은 결).\n  저장값이 boolean 이 아닐 수 있어(미저장이면 null) 조건은 느슨하게 참 판정한다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "환경설정 개인정보 탭 콘텐츠"
    },
    "id": "tab_content_privacy",
    "type": "basic",
    "name": "Div",
    "if": "{{(_global.activeSettingsTab || query.tab) === 'privacy'}}",
    "props": {
        "className": "card-stack"
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "id": "card_privacy_notice",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "alert-info"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "flex gap-3"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "circle-info",
                                "className": "text-xl flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "H3",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-heading"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.privacy.policy_notice_title"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-label-subtle mt-1"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.privacy.policy_notice_desc"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "card_withdrawn_retention",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "card-stack-item"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "H3",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "card-title"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.privacy.withdrawn.title"
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "card-description"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.privacy.withdrawn.desc"
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "row-stack"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "id": "toggle_withdrawn_retention",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex-between"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "flex-center"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "text-heading"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.privacy.withdrawn.enabled"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "if": "{{privacyPreview?.data?.retention?.['user-withdrawn'] !== null && privacyPreview?.data?.retention?.['user-withdrawn'] !== undefined}}",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "badge badge-yellow ml-2"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.privacy.target_count|count={{privacyPreview?.data?.retention?.['user-withdrawn'] ?? 0}}"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "P",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "text-label-subtle"
                                            },
                                            "text": "$t:admin.settings.privacy.withdrawn.enabled_desc"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "if": "{{_local.errors?.['privacy.withdrawn_retention_enabled']}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "form-error"
                                            },
                                            "text": "{{_local.errors?.['privacy.withdrawn_retention_enabled']?.[0] ?? ''}}"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "composite",
                                    "name": "Toggle",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "privacy.withdrawn_retention_enabled",
                                        "size": "md",
                                        "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "field_withdrawn_retention_days",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{!!_local.form?.privacy?.withdrawn_retention_enabled && _local.form?.privacy?.withdrawn_retention_enabled !== '0'}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": ""
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Label",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "form-label"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.privacy.withdrawn.days"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Input",
                                    "props": {
                                        "type": "number",
                                        "name": "privacy.withdrawn_retention_days",
                                        "placeholder": "365",
                                        "min": "{{_local?.form?._meta?.limits?.privacy_retention_days_min ?? 1}}",
                                        "max": "{{_local?.form?._meta?.limits?.privacy_retention_days_max ?? 3650}}",
                                        "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly}}",
                                        "className": "input input-w-md {{_local.errors?.['privacy.withdrawn_retention_days'] ? 'input-error' : ''}}"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "if": "{{_local.errors?.['privacy.withdrawn_retention_days']}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "form-error"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{_local.errors?.['privacy.withdrawn_retention_days']?.[0] ?? ''}}"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-hint mt-1"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.privacy.withdrawn.days_hint"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-error-soft mt-1"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.privacy.withdrawn.irreversible_warning"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
